    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 20, Earth 20, Holy 53, Unholy 15",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The leader of the vanguard of angels that punished Baium and broke down the Tower of Insolence. He actively works to hold back the devils that smashed through the upper floors of the Tower of Insolence. He guides Kel Mahums of the Platinum Tribe into war against the devils for control of the Tower of Insolence. He is called the Fire of Wrath for he wields the sword of judgment without hesitation, compassion or mercy. Angels Lv. 8 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Angels. M. Def. +5% Accuracy +10 Resistance to Holy +10% Atk. Spd. -5% Resistance to Dark -10% Resistance to debuffs +15% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Standard Type Lv. 2 Normal P. Def. and Evasion. One-handed Blunt Weapons Lv. 5 Blunt Weapons Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
